  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that multimodal models with scvi_n200 RNA encoder and imagenet_vit_l image encoder (config_036) achieve the highest accuracy so far (0.715). This experiment tests replacing avgpool aggregation (used in config_036) with transformer aggregation, which could better capture complex interactions between modalities. This comparison isolates the impact of aggregation method on performance, a critical design choice with potential for significant gains. Testing transformer aggregation here directly addresses uncertainty about whether this method outperforms avgpool in multimodal settings."
